WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.305 --> 00:00:07.440
♪ (SOMBER PIANO MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.242
MAN:
<i> Excited about getting out?</i>

00:00:09.942 --> 00:00:11.644
Louis, this is Karen James.

00:00:11.944 --> 00:00:13.546
-Hi, Ms. James.
-Hi.

00:00:15.681 --> 00:00:18.551
I hope you do know
that I very much regret

00:00:19.151 --> 00:00:20.720
what I did to your brother.

00:00:21.387 --> 00:00:25.125
<i> I was a... very dumb kid
 when I did that.</i>

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:29.328
-Used to be the man, right?
-(RAIN POURING)

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:31.464
BEECHER:
<i> I heard you was a mad O.G.</i>

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:34.167
LOUIS:
<i>I did my business with dignity,</i>

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:35.735
<i> self-respect.</i>

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:37.837
That's what you wanna try
to hold on to in here.

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:39.439
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:41.607
INMATE:<i> When he get out,
 after 30 years?</i>

00:00:41.707 --> 00:00:43.342
Released 30? Shit!

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:46.212
(LAUGHING)

00:00:47.513 --> 00:00:51.650
I've tried to use these years
here to be a better human being.

00:00:52.351 --> 00:00:54.287
Have you been thinking
about a job strategy?

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:58.258
You're comfortable
with reading and writing?

00:00:58.625 --> 00:00:59.525
Mm-hmm.

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:01.927
You supposed to be bringin'
the whistle in.

00:01:02.027 --> 00:01:03.630
-A piece?
-BEECHER: Through the auto body.

00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:06.565
-LOUIS: Seriously gon' do this?
-Do what?

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:07.934
Get brothers killed?

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:10.136
That Beecher kid
is gonna get patched.

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:12.037
<i> It's in your best interest
 to stay away from him.</i>

00:01:12.137 --> 00:01:13.606
♪ (MUSIC INTENSIFIES) ♪

00:01:14.073 --> 00:01:15.308
May I say something?

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:19.412
<i> I'm sure that you are
 a different person.</i>

00:01:20.546 --> 00:01:22.282
But I don't want you to get out.

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:26.218
I can't find my way out
of this shit.

00:01:26.652 --> 00:01:28.154
<i> -I need your help.</i>
-(RAUCOUS BICKERING)

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:29.689
I know you know things!

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:32.458
KAREN JAMES:
<i> You should remain in prison</i>

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:34.594
<i> for the rest of your life.</i>

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:37.429
♪ (MUSIC ENDS ABRUPTLY) ♪

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:41.468
LOUIS: There are many days
that I wondered if you're right.

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:44.304
That this is where I belong.

00:01:51.143 --> 00:01:53.213
♪ (MUSIC CONCLUDES) ♪

